  "8": {
   "segId": "Bekhorot.35b.9",
   "sugya": "bekhorot_35a_roei_yisrael_bei_kohanim",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_rn_maaser",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "דאי לא תימא הכי, מעשר לרבי מאיר מי מעיד עליו?",
     "supports": "p_rn_baalim_meidin",
     "status": "rejected"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rn_baalim_meidin",
     "gloss_en": "Rav Nachman: the owners [may] testify about it [the doubtful firstborn]"
    }
   ]
  },
  "9": {
   "segId": "Bekhorot.35b.10",
   "sugya": "bekhorot_35a_roei_yisrael_bei_kohanim",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support_deflection",
     "object": "defl_maaser_vadai_mehaiman",
     "gloss_en": "מעשר ודאי מהימן, דאי בעי שדי ביה מומא בכוליה עדריה",
     "deflects": "s_rn_maaser",
     "refuted": false
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_sfek_bechor_lerm_mi_meid",
     "gloss_en": "rather: a doubtful firstborn -- according to R' Meir who testifies about it?"
    }
   ]
  },
  "10": {
   "segId": "Bekhorot.35b.11",
   "sugya": "bekhorot_35a_roei_yisrael_bei_kohanim",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_vehatnan_rm_mechayev",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "והתנן: כל שחליפיו ביד כהן פטור מן המתנות, ורבי מאיר מחייב -- אלא שמע מינה: בעלים מעידין עליו (kind svara: no tnan support kind)",
     "supports": "p_rn_baalim_meidin",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_lit_lei_takanta",
     "gloss_en": "(entertained) indeed it [the doubtful firstborn, per R' Meir] has no remedy"
    }
   ]
  },
  "13": {
   "segId": "Bekhorot.35b.14",
   "sugya": "bekhorot_35a_roei_yisrael_bei_kohanim",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_umi_amar_rava",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "ומי אמר רבא הכי? והאמר רבא: בעלים עומדים עמנו בחוץ, נכנס שלם ויצא חבול -- מעידין עליו!",
     "against": "p_rava_halakha_ryosei",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_kol_baalim_omdim",
     "gloss_en": "אימא: כל בעלים עומדים, ולא חיישינן -- read Rava's memra as all the owners standing outside (= p_kol_baalim_omdim)",
     "answers": "obj_umi_amar_rava",
     "restores": "p_rava_halakha_ryosei"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rava_baalim_omdim",
     "gloss_en": "Rava: the owners were standing with us outside; it went in whole and came out injured -- they testify about it"
    }
   ]
  },
  "15": {
   "segId": "Bekhorot.35b.16",
   "sugya": "bekhorot_35a_roei_yisrael_bei_kohanim",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_al_pihem_yihye",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "לרבי מאיר דאמר החשוד על הדבר לא דנו ולא מעידו, וקאמר החשוד לדבר אחד חשוד לכל התורה כולה -- כהנים הכי נמי דלא דייני דינא? והכתיב ועל פיהם יהיה כל ריב וכל נגע!",
     "against": "p_rm_chashud_lo_dano",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rm_chashud_ledavar_echad",
     "gloss_en": "and R' Meir says: one suspect regarding one matter is suspect regarding the whole Torah"
    }
   ]
  },
  "14": {
   "segId": "Bekhorot.35b.15",
   "sugya": "bekhorot_35a_roei_yisrael_bei_kohanim",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "ruling",
     "object": "r_halakha_rsbg_bnei_beito",
     "gloss_en": "והלכתא כרבן שמעון בן גמליאל",
     "prop": "p_rn_halakha_rsbg",
     "tension": false
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_lo_chayshinan_lechashada",
     "gloss_en": "lest you say we should be concerned for suspicion -- [Rava] teaches us [we are not]"
    }
   ]
  },
  "0": {
   "segId": "Bekhorot.35b.1",
   "sugya": "bekhorot_35a_roei_yisrael_bei_kohanim",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_r2_taam_tzurba",
     "gloss_en": "for he says: he will not leave a young Torah scholar and give it to me"
    }
   ]
  },
  "1": {
   "segId": "Bekhorot.35b.2",
   "sugya": "bekhorot_35a_roei_yisrael_bei_kohanim",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_r2_ata_rmeir",
     "gloss_en": "reading 2: and R' Meir comes to say: one suspect regarding a matter neither judges it nor testifies about it"
    }
   ]
  },
  "4": {
   "segId": "Bekhorot.35b.5",
   "sugya": "bekhorot_35a_roei_yisrael_bei_kohanim",
   "marks": [
    {
